  "solution": "Sử dụng công thức cộng cosin <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ giả thiết, ta có hệ phương trình\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>cos</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>cos</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTrừ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> theo từng vế, ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.",
